# What may be published, and nothing else.
#
# This repository is a curated slice of a larger working folder. The rule is: if a file is not needed to
# understand, rebuild or reproduce the work, it stays out — and anything carrying private working context or
# personal metadata stays out unconditionally. Check `git status` before every commit.
#
# Note: gitignore has no inline comments. Every comment here is on its own line, deliberately.

# ---- never publish -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLAUDE.md is the private working agreement: preferences, background, session context.
CLAUDE.md
# Office files carry author metadata; the .md twin is the source anyway.
*.docx
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
.env

# ---- generated output ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Built by `node build.js` / `node figures.js`; GitHub Actions rebuilds both on push.
outreach/blog/site/
outreach/blog/assets/figures/

# ---- research archive: keep the evidence, drop the bulk ----------------------------------------------------
# Each run folder is 33-491 MB, almost all of it restart checkpoints and raw slice fields. The JSON series,
# the run log and the analysis are what a reader needs; the rest is reproducible from them plus the code.
*.npz
*.bin
research/nslab/*/checkpoint.json
research/nslab/*/partial.json
research/nslab/*/slices/
# Superseded duplicates of NS-003 under GPU runner 0.1.0.
research/nslab/v0-*/
# Stray file with a Windows-reserved name; it breaks clones on Windows.
research/nslab/nul
# Launcher console logs; the per-run run.log is kept.
research/nslab/*.console.log

# ---- large renders ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1.7 MB Blender renders; the vector set and the .blend are kept.
research/tools/logo/*-3d*.png
research/tools/logo/*.blend1

# ---- working documents that are not part of the public record -----------------------------------------------
research/CFD papers checked 2026-08-22.md
